+*   **NDC Points**: Homogeneous coordinates $(x_{ndc}, y_{ndc}, z_{ndc}, 1)$ [S1, S2, unofficial].
+*   **RayBundle**: A structure containing:
+    *   `rays_o`: Tensor of shape $(N, 3)$ for origins [S4, S6, unofficial].
